# Itens com maior slip estimado pelo DINA (dificuldade de acerto mesmo dominando).
PREFIX prism: <https://prism-edu.example/onto#>
PREFIX rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>

SELECT ?item ?rotulo ?guess ?slip ?status
WHERE {
  ?est a prism:PsychometricEstimate ;
       prism:estimateOfItem ?item ;
       prism:slip ?slip .
  OPTIONAL { ?est prism:guess ?guess }
  OPTIONAL { ?est prism:estimationStatus ?status }
  ?item rdfs:label ?rotulo .
}
ORDER BY DESC(?slip)
LIMIT 25
